# UI/UX (checkout SPA)

## Hierarchy & layout

- Clear visual hierarchy: primary CTA ("Pay with credit card") obvious; one job per screen.
- Mobile-first; usable from iPhone SE width; no horizontal overflow; touch targets ≥44px.
- Backdrop summary: Material Backdrop pattern; keep focus trapped in modal/backdrop while open.

## Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA target)

- Semantic HTML (`main`, `button`, `label`, `dialog`/`role="dialog"` for modals).
- Visible focus rings; full keyboard path through 5-screen flow.
- Labels tied to inputs; errors announced and associated (`aria-describedby` / `aria-invalid`).
- Contrast ≥ 4.5:1 for body text; do not rely on color alone for card brand or errors.
- Images: meaningful `alt` or decorative `alt=""`.

## Consistency

- Shared spacing/type scale; consistent form field states (default/focus/error/disabled).
- Prefer Motion skill timings for modal open/close and status transitions — purposeful, not noisy.
